                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 41,
                            "last_played": 1787462123
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Amazing game, I love the design, the idea, the simplicity, and the ease of being able to get into creating.\n\nThat being said, this game comes with its flaws and bugs: The piston options got me stuck and I had to force shut down the game; Every time I deleted a beam, it would delete sub-category pieces connected to it (springs, pistons, wheels); pieces MUST connect to something, which makes it hard to shape what you want to see in your design.\n\nTHAT being said... creating an engineering game is no easy feat. I commend Hatfuls Games for taking on such a feat and even (if not almost) succeed at it!! Wonderful job on the game... I will be refunding it... Nothing peronal, I just expected a little change over 4 years of this game being around.\n\nRecommended to any engineer that sees this game on sale, and then doesn't mind struggling a little. Happy Trails!",
